IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. LON0020.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    05 C-AG-YY            PIC 9(3).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> MAXIMUM TERM IN YEARS
    05 MT-YY              PIC 9(2) VALUE ZERO.
    05 EL-IND             PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM LOAN-TERM-RULES
    DISPLAY "MT-YY=" MT-YY
    DISPLAY "EL-IND=" EL-IND
    STOP RUN.
LOAN-TERM-RULES.
    IF C-AG-YY >= 18
        *> SHORT TERM FOR OLDER BORROWERS
        IF C-AG-YY > 65
            MOVE 10 TO MT-YY
            MOVE 'Y' TO EL-IND
        ELSE
            *> MEDIUM TERM CAP
            IF C-AG-YY > 55
                MOVE 20 TO MT-YY
                MOVE 'Y' TO EL-IND
            ELSE
                MOVE 30 TO MT-YY
                MOVE 'Y' TO EL-IND
            END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO EL-IND
    END-IF.
